{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>據知情人士透露，軟銀行政總裁孫正義近期接洽華爾街機構，商議融資推進一筆規模達萬億級美元的收購，目標是存儲晶片巨頭SK海力士，但軟銀髮言人表示，孫正義現已不再積極推進該交易。</strong>軟銀髮言人稱：「軟銀會考察大量機會，這筆交易目前已不再納入積極評估範圍。」</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587366.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T09:23:54.708791+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":129,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T09:02:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T09:17:15.716184+00:00","content_hash":"aa23d934f9bf5f8d8e1b5d8e569320c0d8e900af345a88f5436fc3fac82d455f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}